{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPACEFLUX\u00a0</strong>- THE ONE &amp; ONLY<strong> FRACTAL FPS! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>fractal space</strong>, the map contains itself. Going to the center takes you back to where you started. You can never reach the center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/HeadArenaFractalLoop.gif?t=1743116726\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECURSIVE ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to navigate the fractals in hyper-fast PvP combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>infinite</strong> copies of the map, with a copy of <i>you</i> on each map. Be careful, don't shoot yourself in the back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponents have copies too. Shoot any copy to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/recursivecombat.gif?t=1743116726\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE IMPOSSIBLE SPACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fractal space is just 1 of the 6 impossible spaces:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horizontal Loop\u00a0</strong>- the map repeats infinitely in all directions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimap\u00a0</strong>- a mini-version of the map exists within the map. Jump inside to land back onto the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mirror Mode -</strong>\u00a0the map is reflected and so are you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portals\u00a0</strong>- enter a portal to another place in the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vertical Loop</strong> - fall forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/vloop.gif?t=1743116726\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HORDE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The single player roguelike<strong>\u00a0</strong>where you fight endless waves of heads in all impossible spaces. Can you beat <strong>Atomic Pete</strong>, or will he erase you from existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/atomicpete2.gif?t=1743116726\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 Player multiplayer deathmatches</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Fully destructible and impossible maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player survival horde mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on \u2018Psychedelic Mode\u2019 to mess with your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abilities to flip gravity, spawn decoys or disguise yourself as a box</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic gun skins for all 10 weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peer-to-peer matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you so much for your patience and support over the last 4 years of Early Access!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Calin</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter the Flux","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1344440/879a03fc6f5c99d178ea27b501b596dd758a4d7a.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1344440?t=1743116726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/ee487e780fdc891ebd882c12933db622195712c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743116726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/03e004a1e2b77f964ca2963b311217cef4a4b758/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743116726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/03e004a1e2b77f964ca2963b311217cef4a4b758/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743116726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPACEFLUX\u00a0</strong>- THE ONE &amp; ONLY<strong> FRACTAL FPS! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>fractal space</strong>, the map contains itself. Going to the center takes you back to where you started. You can never reach the center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/HeadArenaFractalLoop.gif?t=1743116726\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECURSIVE ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to navigate the fractals in hyper-fast PvP combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>infinite</strong> copies of the map, with a copy of <i>you</i> on each map. Be careful, don't shoot yourself in the back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponents have copies too. Shoot any copy to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/recursivecombat.gif?t=1743116726\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE IMPOSSIBLE SPACES</strong></h2><p 