l 10 weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peer-to-peer matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you so much for your patience and support over the last 4 years of Early Access!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Calin</h2>","developers":["Calin Ardelean"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/806b2c9fe68b6b1badf7041cef573c1fc72bfb8c/header.jpg?t=1743116726","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118826,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118826/movie480.mp4?t=1743115770","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118826/movie_max.mp4?t=1743115770"},"name":"Spaceflux - 1.0 Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118826/64a1d9a0bf26ab41c13276e7694c8eebb21fe148/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743115770","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118826/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743115770","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118826/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743115770"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256949297,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256949297/movie480.mp4?t=1743116724","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256949297/movie_max.mp4?t=1743116724"},"name":"How do the fractals work?","thumbnail":"https://sha